WEBVTT

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:31.116
It's to endure the productive friction

00:14:31.158 --> 00:14:32.993
of coming to common agreement

00:14:33.035 --> 00:14:36.830
with someone who you may not agree with
or perhaps even like.

00:14:37.664 --> 00:14:41.501
And with just enough rules
and a little bit of time,

00:14:41.543 --> 00:14:43.086
I believe that you can do it.

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:45.088
And you just might find,

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:47.132
we all just might find,

00:14:47.132 --> 00:14:49.760
that the most important things that we do

00:14:49.801 --> 00:14:51.970
are the ones that we do together.

00:14:52.596 --> 00:14:53.764
Thank you.

00:14:53.805 --> 00:14:58.060
(Applause)